  "notes": "SIMILAR WORDS:\n- {中止|ちゅうし}: Cancellation, stopping something (often permanent or indefinite)\n- ⟦{中断|ちゅうだん}→中断：05218_chuudan⟧: Interruption, temporary suspension (implies resumption later)\n- ⟦{延期|えんき}→延期：01888_enki⟧: Postponement (rescheduled for later)\n- ⟦{取|と}り{消|け}し→取消：07346_torikeshi⟧: Cancellation, withdrawal (often for reservations, orders)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{中止|ちゅうし}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧ (~ is/gets canceled)\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{中止|ちゅうし}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to cancel ~)\n- {中止|ちゅうし}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦お{知|し}らせ→お知らせ：18843_oshirase⟧ (cancellation notice)",
